<title>MOZAMBIQUE: PRESS DIGEST - Mozambique - Feb 4.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Mozambique - Feb 4.</headline>
<dateline>MAPUTO 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Mozambican press on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>NOTICIAS</p>
<p>- President Joaquim Chissano has denounced parties which preach federalism saying this could destroy national unity.</p>
<p>- Floods in central Mozambique have driven 3,000 families from their homes and submerged parts of the main road between neighbouring Zimbabwe and Beira port.</p>
</text>
